#: data/co.logonoff.awakeonlan.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Awake on LAN is a simple application that allows you to wake up computers "
"remotely using Wake-on-LAN packets. You can keep track of computers by "
"adding, removing, and editing them with their MAC addresses, and you can "
"start them remotely with the click of a button."
msgstr ""

